":"练习","audio":"/audio/3906aa577b0627036d72.mp3","entryId":"92041","definition":"为干好某事反复做到熟练。","pronunciation":["연ː습"]},{"id":"dc76f888ddfaef28","term":"아주","zh":"非常，极其，很","audio":"/audio/dc76f888ddfaef286adb.mp3","entryId":"72484","definition":"表示程度相当高，远远超出了一般程度。","pronunciation":["아주"]},{"id":"5be015e332c130d8","term":"열심히","zh":"认真地","audio":"/audio/5be015e332c130d89835.mp3","entryId":"67512","definition":"对于某事专心诚意地。","pronunciation":["열씸히"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做、进行（피아노 연습을 하다：练钢琴）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"做、进行（피아노 연습을 하다：练钢琴）","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/8b251a23e6f8f2cc6464.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n57957-1-17-2","ko":"다음 주에 학교에서 발표회를 해요.","zh":"下周学校要举办演奏会。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"다음","meaning":"下一个（다음 주：下周）","explanation":"다음：下一个","readings":[{"term":"다음","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64531","senseId":"2","lemma":"다음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다음","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3"}},{"text":"주에","meaning":"周，星期","explanation":"주：周，星期；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"주","audio":"/audio/6234d5b178a8b25809d8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"46811","senseId":"1","lemma":"주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주에","audio":"/audio/28e7aef02277c8ef3bcb.mp3"}},{"text":"학교에서","meaning":"学校","explanation":"학교：学校；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"학교","audio":"/audio/f7b9c878ccca829ab6ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73276","senseId":"1","lemma":"학교","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"학교에서","audio":"/audio/9285b891be0b7c5031dc.mp3"}},{"text":"발표회를","meaning":"演奏汇报会（本句为钢琴表演）","explanation":"발표회：成果展示会、汇报演出；本句指钢琴演奏会；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"발표회","audio":"/audio/8bbf41b45de508bb032e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57957","senseId":"1","lemma":"발표회","origin":"NIKL